{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "I'm Your Solution Provider"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear or use to talk about IT solutions provider."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe common activities at work using short sentences in familiar spoken and written situations. Make the result report from the analysis of the information system, based on the customer requirements, following established rules and protocols"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Participates in simple conversations or simulated situations about the communicative topics for this level through the appropriate use of simple pronunciation aspects, and grammar and vocabulary structures. Recognizes simple ideas on requirement reports, tools for Object Oriented Programming, and other basic programming tools."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Countable and Uncountable Nouns"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>Some nouns are <strong>countable</strong> (we can use them in singular and plural forms). Some are <strong>uncountable</strong> (they only have a singular form).</p>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p><strong>Countable nouns</strong> are the ones that you can count (1, 2, 3...). However, <strong>uncountable nouns</strong> are the ones that need a specific unit to measure them.</p> <p>For example:</p> <p>Use <strong>a / an</strong> with <i>singular countable nouns</i> and add <strong>&ndash;es or &ndash;s </strong>to form the <i>plural form</i>. But, if you want to refer to plural forms with <i>uncountable nouns</i>, you will need to use <strong>some</strong>.</p>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Countable</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Uncountable</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p><i>a company </i></p> <p><i>a business</i></p> <p><i>devices</i></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p><i>some Information </i></p> <p><i>some infrastructure</i></p> <p><i>some knowledge</i></p>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Many or How many? vs Much or How much?</strong></p>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Countable</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Uncountable</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p><strong>How many</strong>&nbsp;is used when you want to ask the <strong>quantity</strong> of something.</p> <p>It is only used with plural <strong>countable nouns. </strong>For example:</p> <p><strong><i>How many problems</i></strong><i> does the program have?</i></p> <p><i>The program <strong>has 2.</strong></i></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p><strong>How much</strong>&nbsp;is used to ask for the <strong>price</strong> or <strong>the amount</strong> of something.</p> <p>It is used with <strong>uncountable nouns. </strong>You always use the noun in singular with how much, but you can answer the question using a plural. For example:</p> <p><strong><i>How much information</i></strong><i> does the manager need?</i></p> <p><i>He needs <strong>a lot of information</strong>.</i></p> <p><i>He needs <strong>3 books</strong> that have that information.</i></p>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I checked your account and it seems that you accidentally downloaded a software that is incompatible with ours."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm sorry, I don't think I did it right, the system is showing a black screen."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We lost information about providers, employees' personal information, and other businesses' financial information."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Also, when you set up the new infrastructure and some devices weren't properly converted, this could cause the failure."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "solution provider "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a service provider or a value-added reseller who manages the project needs of their client "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get in touch with my IT solutions provider's help desk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "help desk "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a service that provides information and assistance to people or companies, especially those using networks and servers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Thank you for calling our help desk, how can I help you?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remote access "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ability to connect to a central computer from a distant location using a network"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like remote access or would you like to book a visit?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spyware "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "software that gathers general information or personal information such as passwords, without the user's knowledge"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some of the records in the system show an updated malicious anti-spyware, that's why your server crashed. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drag "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move icons or items on a computer screen using a mouse"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to start your server, click on delete all provider information, drag the mouse to the infrastructure back up icon, and click reset."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "get in touch with "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "approach, contact, or try to reach someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get in touch with my IT solutions provider's help desk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about IT problems and solutions in enterprises."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe how they work"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a summary of the problem and its solution"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your paragraph to your classmates and teacher"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for information"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe how it works "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a summary of the problem"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I show my paragraph"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "How to talk to a client"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Every company or business that deals with clients need to develop certain attitudes and behaviors to deal with and talk to clients. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Below there is a graph that shows the main areas to learn how to talk to a customer successfully."}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02img01.jpg"}], "type": "learning_points"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 8, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n3le02ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p><strong>IT</strong>: Good morning! Thank you for calling our helpdesk, how can I help you?&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Customer</strong>: Good morning. I need to get in touch with my IT solutions provider's helpdesk. Something is wrong with our server. I talked to an Engineer earlier who said that I should call a solution provider, so they can help me to solve the problems with the software. I&rsquo;m really worried because we lost all human resources information and sensitive confidential information was involved. For instance, we lost information about providers, employees' personal information, and other businesses' financial information. What can I do?&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>IT</strong>: Would you like remote access or would you like to book a visit?&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Customer</strong>: Remote assistance, please.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"time": "44000", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p><strong>IT</strong>: I checked your account and it seems that you accidentally downloaded a software that is incompatible with ours. Some of the records in the system show an updated malicious anti-spyware, that's why your server crashed. Also, when you set up the new infrastructure and some devices weren't properly converted, you caused a failure.</p>\n<p><strong>Customer</strong>: So, what do I need to do now?&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>IT</strong>: There are different solutions: first, I can remotely create a backup and try to rescue the information you lost; if that doesn&rsquo;t work, we can install two servers to store the information. I have a technology provider that could give you a hand with that, then we focus on recovering the information.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"time": "82000", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p><strong>Customer</strong>: Let&rsquo;s try with the remote access and see if it works.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>IT</strong>: Absolutely. You need to start your server, click on delete all provider information, drag the mouse to the infrastructure back up icon, and click reset. Then, the server will pop up a request window, accept it so the system can upload again.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Customer</strong>: I'm sorry, I don't think I did it right, the system is showing a black screen.</p>\n<p><strong>IT</strong>: Not a problem! Our client's needs are very important to us. That's why I'm sending someone to your business right now.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Customer</strong>: Thank you!</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n3le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can explain how to solve a specific problem related to IT in a small business."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about different possible problems in a small business."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can identify a problem and a solution in a small business."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "How should IT providers talk to customers?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What does help desk need to do to provide assistance effectively?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": 